{"parse": {"title": "飞渡往日-05", "pageid": 55487, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E6%B8%A1%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5-04\" title=\"飞渡往日-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">飞渡往日-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%9E%E6%B8%A1%E5%BE%80%E6%97%A5-06\" title=\"飞渡往日-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">飞渡往日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E6.9D.82.E6.8A.80.E8.A1.A8.E6.BC.94.E2.80.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“杂技表演”\">“杂技表演”</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> “杂技表演”</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">\"Air Farce\"</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1960105</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_weiyenahepan\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_weiyenahepan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>河岸旁，游人三两成群，近半个世纪的繁荣与和平塑造了对新世纪的美好愿景。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>先是黑夜，再是蓝天，接着还将征服天空更远的天外——人们如此笃信，未来必将远胜当今。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>嘿，朋友们，让让，烦请让让——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>聚光灯准备好了吗？我会付钱的，杰克，会的，就这一次！你信我！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>谢谢，先生，就一小会儿，我保证，最迟半个钟头，绝不影响您工作！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>工程师忙着在河畔广场给自己抢出一块空地，跟他不耐烦的记者朋友们一一赔笑，同时紧张布置着场地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>我跟你保证，接下来你将拍下本世纪最了不起的几张照片，别说《纽约太阳报》了，就是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>好好好，我去跟我的助手聊聊，她马上就来，马上就来！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>工程师敛起他硬邦邦的假笑，一边擦汗，一边跑向机械女士，搬运下沉重的金属架。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我会尽快把设备组装好，不会超过五分钟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>……我有个办法，露西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>我们承受不起失败，你明白的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>工程师压低声音，左右环视，悄悄给出自己的“建议”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>用一下你的神秘术，真的，有几个地方我还是不放心，最好还是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你的意思是，要我使用神秘术改变机械结构，从而保证这次实验的成功？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>对对对对对，就、就是这个意思……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>不，我拒绝这个提议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>啊？为什么？你怎么——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>神秘术的时效有限，而且存在失败的风险。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>我们本来就没什么胜算！再往赌桌上扔两块筹码又怎么样！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>维克多，我不可能对将来生产的每一台设备都施加神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>也不可能在每一个使用它的人起飞前都为他们施加神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这不是一条可行之道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>如果接下来要进行大规模生产，那必须基于稳定、可控、可复制的方案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士比她的伙伴看得更远，因为工程师并非马戏团的杂耍艺人或兜售神秘学小玩意儿的江湖术士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>所以我拒绝这个提议。去把机翼搬下来，该把它们组装起来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>噢，你在想什么？如果今天不能成功，这事儿就没有以后了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>伙计！你听我的，对燃气机动动手，让记者们拍下你在天上打招呼的漂亮样子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>公司会回心转意，然后求着我们继续这个项目，到时候我们愿意要多少，他们就会给多少！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>一千、一万、十万美元……那些钞票叠起来比你我加起来还高！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>嗯，所以你要一堆叠起来三米多高的纸做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>不为这个，我为什么要偷走老屋里的那堆写满潦草笔记的旧纸稿，千里迢迢跑波士顿来搞实验？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我不关心你的动机，维克多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我在乎的是这个项目很有前景，仅此而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维克多扔下攥在手中的稿纸，露西将这些不受主人待见的梦想一一捡起，放回车上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>它们还有用处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>哼，但愿如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>工程师气冲冲地转身离开，转眼间，那露骨的假笑又挤上脸庞，朝向众人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>寥寥无几的“众人”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>维克多，把人群疏散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我不想发生意外的时候伤到路人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>烦请诸位让让，我的助手十分体贴而谨慎，尽管这个发明堪称完美，绝无意外可能……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>但本着人道主义和科学精神，她依然考虑到了最最极端的、几乎不可能发生的情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>接下来请诸位见证维克多工作室的杰作：单人挂载式飞行翼，只需要操纵摇杆，按下按钮，您就能畅享翱翔天空的乐趣！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>再等等，维克多，现在不是时候。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>风向很乱，不能在这时候起飞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>请诸位原谅，恐怕我们需要再对设备进行一次最终调试，为保证展出效果，请再耐心等待短短的两分钟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">围观游人：</div><div>你们是哪个马戏团来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>波士顿的维克多工作室，先生，绝非魔术马戏，也并非神秘学家的小把戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">围观游人：</div><div>一个机器人？一个装在机器人背上的机器翅膀？哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">围观游人：</div><div>我倒想瞧瞧这里头有些什么门道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>我们不能等太久，伙计，大家已经不耐烦了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>等到风向有利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你为什么着急？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风吹过河面。<br />游船上，无所事事的居民聚在船舷边，远远看向岸上的两人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>再等下去，别说路人了，连记者都会撤走！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>是吗？这会给项目研究带来什么麻烦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>聚光灯对飞行有什么益处？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>站在河岸边的游人的目光是否能改良机械结构？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>……如果没有观众，那今天做的这一切有什么意义？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们会用一次精彩的试飞来验证近期的研究成果。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>即便失败，也能从中找到改进的道路。我不认为这是个悲观的梦想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>从第一盏风筝发明以来，人类就憧憬着乘风飞起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>而近些年人类在材料科学和内燃机领域取得的硕果，则使梦想成为了初步具有可行性的现实方案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>维克多，一次失败会怎么样呢？你已经失败了上百次，这不过是给分母数字再加一个最小正整数而已。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>焦躁的工程师无言以对。西风拂过河岸，向缅因湾的湛蓝海水奔去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>起风了，伙计！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>动起来，快，动起来——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>祝我们顺利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士将飞行翼装上自己的暗银色手臂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>银翼的飞鸟走到岸边，启动按钮，滚烫蒸汽自灼热的排热管道涌出——而非出自她那伟大的活塞核心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>神秘术缄默不语，在此发出轰鸣的乃是基于人类科学而完成的金属飞翼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我感觉这比之前任何一次都更好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>准备好了吗——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>各位，请看，请睁大双眼——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>你们即将见证人类两千年来最伟大的一项发明！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>它将云海化为大地，叫天空成为无水之海，我们将能畅游其中！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如同七十年前那位向着大海奔跑飞起的女孩，机械女士展开银翼，向着查尔斯河一跃而下。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-hean.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"hean\"><img alt=\"hean\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/Cg-hean.png/600px-Cg-hean.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/Cg-hean.png/900px-Cg-hean.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f3/Cg-hean.png/1200px-Cg-hean.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">围观游人：</div><div>嘿，她跳了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">围观游人：</div><div>她真的能飞起来吗？就靠那鸟翅膀玩意儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有好事之徒期盼的落水声。水鸟振翅而起，被燃气驱动的爆鸣声惊飞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308610.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-308610.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308610.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308610.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-308610.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308610.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-308610.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308610.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……比我预想中糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>看，看，她从河堤下面起来了！正是如此！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>飞啊，飞！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>工程师额边汗珠不断。他紧握双手，屏住呼吸，目光跟随着银翼的飞鸟掠过河面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>攥在手中的麻黄色设计稿纸被汗水浸湿，几乎揉作一卷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-308611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-308611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-308611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>维克多——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>安全、稳定、可靠，只需要简单阅读我们的使用手册，就是八岁小孩也能熟练掌握这一机械的驾驶方法。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>它比飞机更廉价，比火车更轻巧，比轮船更便捷——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-308611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-308611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-308611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>维克多！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>只需要投入小小的一笔资金，我保证，不出一年，这笔投资将带给您难以想象的丰厚回报！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>有什么比这更好的机会呢？现在，就是现在，财富与光荣正向你我招手，正如这高高飞起的梦想——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>燃油快耗尽了，维克多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蒸汽从河岸上消失了，淡如正午的雾，在风中迅速消散。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">围观游人：</div><div>你的梦想摔下去了，伙计。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/39/HeadIconSmall-505601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">围观游人：</div><div>嘿，她落水了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>工程师目瞪口呆，为查尔斯河溅起的水花惊得说不出话来。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_weiyenahepan\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_weiyenahepan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_weiyenahepan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>不！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>不……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>落水的飞鸟卸掉双翼，从水中浮起，游回岸边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我想我知道问题在哪了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>现有的发动机根本不能支持如此巨大的能耗，风和燃油提供的动力都不够。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>维克多，这套强行拼凑连接的核心系统没有意义，这只会加快燃料消耗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>真正需要的是改进效率，提高输出功率。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>是吗？那你去折腾吧。无所谓了，伙计，祝你好运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>没人会往这个项目投钱，一分钱也不会投。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>这**就是个愚蠢的赔本生意！十年！二十年！五十年都回不了本！我的钱……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>机械女士擦去金属身躯上的水珠，走回岸边，走向散去的人群，捡起那摞被主人遗弃的设计稿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它们不该被如此抛弃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你要和希梅娜一样，走到半路就离开吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">维克多：</div><div>就这样吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>维克多用一声叹息为自己短暂的尝试画上句号。<br />他压低帽檐，转身消失在河畔人潮中，为自己的失败落荒而逃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这和之前的每一次失败没什么不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>我们已经找到了改进的方向。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>这不过是一个小小的挫折，一段弯路，一场不成功的展出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个望向天空的梦想，却受挫于脚边的几张纸钞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>你看到的只有自己伸手就能握住的东西，维克多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>比起人类来说，天空或许更有耐心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她紧握住那一张张散落的梦想，将其整理归档，拖拽着落水的飞翼，沉默地回到自己的命运中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她不会停下脚步，永远不会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>他走到半路，就像面对马特洪峰的旅人，被眼前的高山和苦厄吓坏了，于是转身离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"513001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"513001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-513001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-513001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">露西：</div><div>但还有人——在他身后，还会有很多人向着高山飞去。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "飞渡往日-05"}}